# Sample MCP Tool Call Request
File: mcp/examples/tool_call_request.oot

## Request

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "get_orientation",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}
```

arguments is a JSON object.

## Expected

result.content[0].type = text

result.content[0].text = the OODACODEX body
